---
import BusinessNameGenerator from '../components/BusinessNameGenerator.astro';
import ToolLayout from '../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---
<ToolLayout title="Business Name Generator — Practical name ideas | Bizzon" description="Free browser-based Business Name Generator by Bizzon. Generate practical business, project, product, and domain-name ideas from your own keywords." canonicalPath="/business-name-generator" heading="Business Name Generator" intro="Generate practical business-name ideas from the words that describe your offer, audience, product, or location.">
  <BusinessNameGenerator />
  <section class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Start with your real words</h2><p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">Use words your customers might recognize: what you sell, who it helps, where you work, or what makes the offer distinct.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Shortlist, then check</h2><p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">A generated idea is only a starting point. Check trademarks, company registers, social handles, and domain availability before using it.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Keep it clear</h2><p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">The strongest names are usually easy to say, spell, remember, and connect to the business without a long explanation.</p></div></section>
  <section class="mt-10 rounded-[2rem] border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 p-6 md:p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">Related tools</h2><p class="mt-4 text-slate-700">Turn a selected name into a clean URL with the <a class="font-bold text-blue-700" href="/slug-generator">Slug Generator</a>. Check social profile length with the <a class="font-bold text-blue-700" href="/social-bio-formatter">Social Bio Formatter</a> or polish a page title in the <a class="font-bold text-blue-700" href="/meta-title-description-checker">Meta Title &amp; Description Checker</a>.</p></section>
</ToolLayout>
